<title>POLAND: CELULOZA PLANS NO 1996 DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>CELULOZA PLANS NO 1996 DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish paper firm Celuloza Swiecie SA plans to earmark its entire 1996 net profit of 74.8 million zlotys to reserve capital and for bonuses for employees and management, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Management's proposal will be voted on at a general shareholders meeting on May 27.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
